      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Entrance hall\r\n3.12 x 1.59\r\nLaminate flooring & understairs storage\r\n\r\nLiving room\r\n5.18 x 3.23\r\nLaminate flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n2.22 x 3.03\r\nFully tiled floors & walls with door to the rear.\r\n\r\nShower Room\r\n3.21 x 2.32\r\nFully tiled floor & walls, whb, wc & electric shower\r\n\r\nFirst floor.\r\nLanding\r\n1.76 x 1\r\n\r\nBathroom,\r\n1.65 x 1.83\r\nWc, whb & Bath\r\n\r\nBedroom 1. (Rear)\r\n2.65 x 3.84\r\nLaminate flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (rear)\r\n3.80 x 2.59\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (front)\r\n2.87 x 1.68\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nEnclosed low maintenance rear garden with mature hedging & a concrete shed"
